## HQ Web UI — Tailscale-only via `tailscale serve`.
# Caddy listens on loopback only; `tailscale serve` terminates TLS on the
# tailnet and forwards to http://127.0.0.1:4749. Not reachable from the
# public internet: nothing here binds a public interface.
#
# One-time on the VPS (443 is already taken by the public MCP Caddyfile, so
# serve on an alternate HTTPS port instead of fighting over the shared bind):
#   tailscale serve --bg --https=8443 http://127.0.0.1:4749
# Access: https://hq.example.ts.net:8443/
#
# hq.service serves everything on :5678: the PWA's static build, /api, /ws
# and /mcp. HTTP/1.1 keeps the /ws upgrade working through the proxy.
:4749 {
	bind 127.0.0.1

	reverse_proxy localhost:5678 {
		transport http {
			versions 1.1
		}
	}
}
